= [Interpreter]Mermaid
https://mermaid-js.github.io/mermaid/#/
Mermaid 문법으로 flowchart, sequence diagram, gantt, class diagram 등을 렌더링합니다.
다이어그램 종류는 Mermaid 코드의 첫 줄에서 정합니다.

[[[#!WikiSyntaxPreview Mermaid
graph TD;
    A-->B;
    A-->C;
    B-->D;
    C-->D;
]]]


[[[#!WikiSyntaxPreview Mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Alice
    participant Bob
    Alice->>John: Hello John, how are you?
    loop Healthcheck
        John->>John: Fight against hypochondria
    end
    Note right of John: Rational thoughts <br/>prevail!
    John-->>Alice: Great!
    John->>Bob: How about you?
    Bob-->>John: Jolly good!
]]]


